          "description": "This peaceful audio invites kids to relax, breathe, and use their imagination as they’re gently guided through calming scenes like autumn walks, picnics, and floating rivers. With soft narration and soothing soundscapes, each short meditation helps children connect with their senses and inner calm. Created especially for ages 4–10, it’s the perfect tool for winding down after a busy day, easing into bedtime, or taking a quiet moment anytime it’s needed.",
